SixIsland_RuinValley_StoneDen_Text_T0Intro::
    .string "Nothing leaves this valley. Nothing\n"
    .string "enters.$"

SixIsland_RuinValley_StoneDen_Text_T0Defeat::
    .string "Crumbled...$"

SixIsland_RuinValley_StoneDen_Text_T0Post::
    .string "Deeper in, the stone is older.$"

SixIsland_RuinValley_StoneDen_Text_T1Intro::
    .string "The ancient one woke when the sky\n"
    .string "cracked. We keep watch.$"

SixIsland_RuinValley_StoneDen_Text_T1Defeat::
    .string "Ground to dust.$"

SixIsland_RuinValley_StoneDen_Text_T1Post::
    .string "The WARDEN does not bend.$"

SixIsland_RuinValley_StoneDen_Text_T2Intro::
    .string "Turn back. Stone remembers\n"
    .string "everything.$"

SixIsland_RuinValley_StoneDen_Text_T2Defeat::
    .string "The wall gave way.$"

SixIsland_RuinValley_StoneDen_Text_T2Post::
    .string "Mind your footing ahead.$"

SixIsland_RuinValley_StoneDen_Text_T3Intro::
    .string "The beast shelters us from the\n"
    .string "broken sky. We stay for it.$"

SixIsland_RuinValley_StoneDen_Text_T3Defeat::
    .string "The cairn falls.$"

SixIsland_RuinValley_StoneDen_Text_T3Post::
    .string "Last room. Mind your pride.$"

SixIsland_RuinValley_StoneDen_Text_T4Intro::
    .string "I am the WARDEN of the STONE.\n"
    .string "The beast sleeps in my care.\p"
    .string "Prove that your will is worth\n"
    .string "more than my fear.$"

SixIsland_RuinValley_StoneDen_Text_T4Defeat::
    .string "...Then the stone has chosen you.$"

SixIsland_RuinValley_StoneDen_Text_T4Post::
    .string "Go. Let it rest after.$"

SixIsland_RuinValley_StoneDen_Text_GuardsLeft::
    .string "The beast does not stir.\n"
    .string "Its guardians still stand watch.$"
